WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
First change an input and record at least three observations.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Compare, build a rule, and explain how the parts connect.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Commit your prediction before running the test. Keep the earlier prediction when revising.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A new context tests transfer. Hints help you learn but are recorded as support.
